  - elementId: c-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [76, 482, 928, 92]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [right, top]
      text: |
        <p>‫<span style="color:$green">REAL:</span> Sessions وProviders وModifiers وMCP origin guard وworkbench تجريبي.‬</p>
        <p>‫<span style="color:$amber">EXTERNAL:</span> OAuth custody وtool search وmeta execution وhosted MCP وremote sandbox.‬</p>
        <p>‫<span style="color:$coral">الربط:</span> Ollama عبر OpenAI/typesafe، وLangflow عبر langchain/MCP؛ الترخيص MIT/ISC/Apache.‬</p>

