  - elementId: t-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [76, 666, 928, 92]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [right, top]
      text: |
        <p>‫<span style="color:$green">REAL:</span> pgvector وcontext pruning/compaction وrate limits وcron وglen memory.‬</p>
        <p>‫<span style="color:$amber">EXTERNAL:</span> Vercel AI Gateway وComposio وremote sandbox؛ ليس Offline.‬</p>
        <p>‫<span style="color:$coral">الفائدة:</span> memory-search/save وcontext-window وtoken-estimation وrate-limit.‬</p>

